# build artifacts
#
# `out/` is the only place build products go: `out/<target>/<arch>/lens` for
# installed binaries, `out/.cargo` for cargo's intermediates (CARGO_TARGET_DIR
# is pinned there by the Makefile). Nothing is written to `target/`, but ignore
# it anyway for the case where cargo is invoked without the Makefile.
/out/
/target/

# editor / OS
*.swp
.DS_Store

# design spec, kept out of tree
LENS.md
